Individual download IDs and source information are in manifest.json.

Modifications for this application:
- Normalized SVG color attributes to currentColor and removed web display styles.
- Rendered PNG variants for the application's light and dark icon themes.
- Added a diagonal slash to bluetooth-line to create bluetooth-disabled-line.
